<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">同族<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0002" ref="726_jlm_j1k">王文和</persName>，宋鎮北大將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0012" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">仲德</persName>兄孫也。景和中，為義陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0026" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>征北府主簿。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0033" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>于彭城奔虜，部曲皆散，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0045" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>獨送至界上。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0053" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>謂之曰：「諸人皆去，卿有<rs id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:u0066" type="unresolved">老母</rs>，何不去邪！」<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0075" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>乃去。昇明中，為巴陵內史。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0090" ref="16c_0og_lvl_A">沈攸之</persName>事起，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:m0096" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>斬其<rs id="c-nanqishu-027-wangwenhe:p001:u0100" type="unresolved">使</rs>，馳白世祖告變，棄郡奔郢城。永明中，歷青、冀、兖、益四州刺史，平北將軍。</p>
</text>
